  "description": "<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Pro DJ Masterclass </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Pro DJ Masterclass is a Crashcourse for people who want to learn how to DJ and make money with gigs fast, no matter what their current profession is or if they have any previous experience as a DJ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Here the student will learn to make their wish become a reality and find out the keys to success as a professional DJ, only by teaching the student online.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">In this Masterclass the student will learn how to become a skilled DJ as fast as possible. We will help you transform the student from Beginner to Advanced Level DJ and share our valuable&nbsp; knowledge with them so the student can feel safe and prepared to get out there and build a fanbase with confidence, always ahead of the competition.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">It doesn't matter how old the student is and it doesn't matter if he/she wants to play house or techno, the principles stay the same.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The student will even learn to market himself so promoters will be interested in booking him/her for gigs.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 1em; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">The course includes:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"color: rgb(33, 43, 54); font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\r\n<li>At least 2 hours of educational material&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>24 Chapters and 43 Lessons</li>\r\n<li>26 Quizzes in between to double check the students understanding of previous lessons.</li>\r\n<li>Text - and Video Content</li>\r\n<li>Student can view the Masterclass online and download them if preferred.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Completion of lessons online are tracked so the student can easily&nbsp;start right where he/she left.</li>\r\n<li>Course Language: English&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Student receives Certificate after successful Masterclass completion.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>! Before the student can buy the course on our website, he must first create an account in order to access the course after loggin in to his account.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>--&gt; Some Keywords you can use to sell this course: Techno music, House music, Electronic music, How to DJ, DJ course, Djing howto, Artist marketing</p>",
